#: plugins/sso/templates/sso/login_subtemplate.html
#, python-format
msgid "Login via %(name)s"
msgstr "Se connecter via %(name)s"

#: plugins/sso/templates/sso/new_account_email.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"This is an automated message generated by the %(site_name)s authentication "
"system.\n"
"\n"
"A new user account, %(first_name)s %(last_name)s `%(username)s`, has been "
"successfully created through SSO authentication.\n"
"However, the account currently lacks assigned permissions. This absence of "
"permissions prevent the user from fully utilizing our services.\n"
"\n"
"You can grant the necessary permissions by clicking on the following link: "
"%(profile_url)s\n"
"\n"
"We kindly ask that you review this situation at your earliest convenience "
"and take the necessary steps to assign the appropriate permissions to this "
"user account.\n"
"\n"
"If you require any additional information or encounter any issues, please do "
"not reply to this automated email, but contact the staff directly.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter. Your efforts greatly "
"contribute to the smooth operation and user-friendliness of our platform.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,\n"
"The %(site_name)s Team.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Ceci est un message automatique généré par le système d'authentification "
"%(site_name)s.\n"
"\n"
"Un nouveau compte utilisateur, %(first_name)s %(last_name)s `%(username)s`, "
"a été créé avec succès via l'authentification SSO.\n"
"Cependant, ce compte ne dispose actuellement d'aucune permission. Cette "
"absence de permissions empêche l'utilisateur d'utiliser pleinement nos "
"services.\n"
"\n"
"Vous pouvez accorder les permissions nécessaires en cliquant sur le lien "
"suivant : %(profile_url)s\n"
"\n"
"Nous vous demandons de bien vouloir examiner cette situation dans les "
"meilleurs délais et de prendre les mesures nécessaires pour attribuer les "
"permissions appropriées à ce compte utilisateur.\n"
"\n"
"Si vous avez besoin d'informations supplémentaires ou rencontrez des "
"problèmes, veuillez ne pas répondre à cet e-mail automatique, mais "
"contacter directement le personnel.\n"
"\n"
"Merci de votre attention rapide à cette question. Vos efforts contribuent "
"grandement au bon fonctionnement et à la convivialité de notre plateforme.\n"
"\n"
"Cordialement,\n"
"L'équipe %(site_name)s.\n"

#: plugins/sso/templates/sso/new_account_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "New User Account %(username)s Awaiting Access Permissions"
msgstr "Nouveau compte utilisateur %(username)s en attente de permissions"
